<title>USA: Belleville Twp HSD 201, Ill. won by Bernardi.</title>
<headline>Belleville Twp HSD 201, Ill. won by Bernardi.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bernardi Securities said it won $2.83 million of Belleville Twp HSD 201, Ill., fire prevention &amp; safety bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.0273 percent.</p>
